# Source: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nuccore/NC_045512.2
#   https://genome.ucsc.edu/FAQ/FAQformat.html#format1
# Symptom: BED3 file for a viral genome (SARS-CoV-2, NC_045512.2) with a
#   single-segment, ~30kb chromosome; validators that only accept chr* names
#   or enforce minimum coordinate counts for human/mouse genomes will
#   incorrectly reject this.  chromEnd (29903) is the actual genome length.
#   Valid: chrom name is an NCBI accession without "chr" prefix, coordinates
#   are within the short viral genome, BED3 minimum format is used.
NC_045512.2	0	29903
NC_045512.2	0	265
NC_045512.2	266	21555
NC_045512.2	21562	25384
